>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
*> Batch control / proof totals (124 bytes)
*> opening + credits - debits + interest = final
01 CONTROL-RECORD.
    05 CTL-STATUS            PIC X(04).
        88 CTL-BALANCED     VALUE "BAL ".
        88 CTL-OUT-OF-BAL   VALUE "OUTB".
    05 CTL-ACCOUNTS         PIC 9(06).
    05 CTL-JOURNAL          PIC 9(06).
    05 CTL-EXCEPTIONS      PIC 9(06).
    05 CTL-INTEREST-ROWS   PIC 9(06).
    05 CTL-OPENING          PIC S9(13)V99 SIGN IS LEADING SEPARATE.
    05 CTL-CREDITS          PIC S9(13)V99 SIGN IS LEADING SEPARATE.
    05 CTL-DEBITS           PIC S9(13)V99 SIGN IS LEADING SEPARATE.
    05 CTL-INTEREST         PIC S9(13)V99 SIGN IS LEADING SEPARATE.
    05 CTL-FINAL            PIC S9(13)V99 SIGN IS LEADING SEPARATE.
    05 CTL-EXPECTED         PIC S9(13)V99 SIGN IS LEADING SEPARATE.
